      "explanation": "RC1 requires active screening for new stroke/TIA symptoms and bleeding risks. The doctor performed explicit screening for acute neurological deficits and bleeding warnings (e.g., ‘如果出现…黑便、呕血…’), and stated that any such signs warrant emergency evaluation, satisfying all required evidence.",
